  <Groups>
    <Group elementId="CPLX-2242" textLabel="CPLX-2242" type="Complex">
      <Xref identifier="CPLX-2242" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="215" width="140" height="100" textColor="666666" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10" borderColor="9900CC" borderStyle="Dashed" borderWidth="2.0" fillColor="F5E6FF" shapeType="Rectangle" zOrder="-1" />
      <Comment>The Arabidopsis gene encoding agmatine iminohydrolase was expressed in &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt;. The protein was expressed as a C-terminal His&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt; tag fusion protein and purified by Ni&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;-chelate affinity chromatography to apparent homogeneity |CITS:[12782327]|. The purified recombinant protein was shown to convert agmatine to &lt;i&gt;N&lt;/i&gt;-carbamoylputrescine and ammonia.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="CPLX-2242" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="agmatine deiminase" />
